21ba8/dark-mode-stocks-app-dark-only-mode%402x.png","line":23,"embedded":true},{"title":"Dark Mode colors","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode#Dark-Mode-colors","line":27},{"title":"Specifications","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/color#Specifications","line":29},{"title":"`controlColor`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSColor/controlColor","line":31},{"title":"`labelColor`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSColor/labelColor","line":31},{"title":"`separator`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIColor/separator","line":31},{"title":"An illustration of a square with a light background and four color swatches representing system colors in the light appearance.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/083d8f0f70c26b7fdea230f7da1edfeb/dark-mode-system-colors-light%402x.png","line":33,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a square with a dark background and four color swatches representing system colors in the dark appearance.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/247df4f7b00e65cdd3827de84135fcda/dark-mode-system-colors-dark%402x.png","line":35,"embedded":true},{"title":"Icons and images","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode#Icons-and-images","line":41},{"title":"SF Symbols","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sf-symbols","line":43},{"title":"Color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/color","line":45},{"title":"An illustration of a black droplet icon against a light background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5377a16f9c47c32d5716a2de9e7e5ddb/dark-mode-icon-in-light-mode%402x.png","line":49,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a black droplet icon against a dark background. The icon has a white border to distinguish it from the similar surrounding color.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a2ebe256a3e677367cc3e965e8282168/dark-mode-icon-in-dark-mode%402x.png","line":51,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of two people sitting at a restaurant table done in a simple, abstract style. The illustration has a light background and its details are clearly visible.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/017a90f0e42a841edec3d4238f408e9e/dark-mode-illustration-in-light-mode%402x.png","line":55,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of two people sitting at a restaurant table done in a simple, abstract style. The illustration has a dark background, and the darker portions of the image are hard to distinguish from the background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/97c07bc517069bf9175e7a3374ed95aa/dark-mode-illustration-in-dark-mode-incorrect%402x.png","line":57,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of two people sitting at a restaurant table done in a simple, abstract style. The illustration has a dark background, and its color values are adjusted to be clearly visible in contrast to the background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/fa4aec31ae33aadce2ed0a0434c9c605/dark-mode-illustration-in-dark-mode-correct%402x.png","line":59,"embedded":true},{"title":"Text","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode#Text","line":61},{"title":"An illustration of a button in the light appearance with dark primary label text.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4dc33e45cd6cae3da766f885044174e9/dark-mode-label-in-light-mode%402x.png","line":67,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a button in the dark appearance with light secondary label text.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5a2df784b29a55d1db485c30efb94009/dark-mode-label-in-dark-mode%402x.png","line":69,"embedded":true},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode#Platform-considerations","line":73},{"title":"iOS, iPadOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode#iOS-iPadOS","line":77},{"title":"A diagram that shows a stack of 4 terms on top of a black background. The term at the top shows the most contrast with the background and the term at the bottom shows the least.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0d71ac9f5186541dce35b5f702311bd0/base-with-four-semantic-colors%402x.png","line":81,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows a stack of 4 terms on top of a nearly black background. The term at the top shows the most contrast with the background and the term at the bottom shows the least.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0dacc182adc819b08eb8cdcc897b08a4/elevated-with-four-semantic-colors%402x.png","line":83,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows a stack of 4 terms on top of a white background. The term at the top shows the most contrast with the background and the term at the bottom shows the least.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/cbbe9a39049fd3d3d2122876de64d207/light-with-four-semantic-colors%402x.png","line":85,"embedded":true},{"title":"macOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode#macOS","line":89},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode#Resources","line":95},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode#Related","line":97},{"title":"Color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/color","line":99},{"title":"Materials","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/materials","line":101},{"title":"Typography","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/typography","line":103},{"title":"Videos","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode#Videos","line":105},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/3055294D-836B-4513-B7B0-0BC5666246B0/5CD0E251-424E-490F-89CF-1E64848209A6/9910_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":107},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/48/174747D6-8723-4194-A932-7765179F1108/2949_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":109},{"title":"Change log","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode#Change-log","line":111}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills-main/plugins/antigravity-awesome-skills/skills/hig-foundations/references/dark-mode.md"},
